sequenceDiagram
    participant App as App<br>[implements GattClientResponse]
    participant Node as Node<br>[implements GattClient]
    participant Peripheral as BLE Peripheral

    Note over Node, Peripheral: Messages between Node and BLE Peripheral<br>are link-layer events, not driven by the App.<br>The App only observes them through<br>Echo callbacks (e.g. OperationComplete).

    App->>Node: GattClient.WriteCharacteristic(<br>handle=0x0045, data=0x01)

    alt Successful write
        Node-)Peripheral: ATT_WRITE_REQ (handle=0x0045, value=0x01)
        Peripheral-)Node: ATT_WRITE_RSP
        Node-->>App: GattClientResponse.OperationComplete(success)
    else ATT error (e.g. write not permitted)
        Node-)Peripheral: ATT_WRITE_REQ (handle=0x0045, value=0x01)
        Peripheral-)Node: ATT_ERROR_RSP (error code)
        Node-->>App: GattClientResponse.OperationComplete(error)
    end
